      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\nThe multi-draw-indirect feature allows issuing multiple draws with a single command. This is useful for rendering thousands if not millions of objects in GPU driven rendering.\n```\n\nAnd TBH sending millions of drawcalls like this will cause issues because it will likely stall the frontend of the GPU for a long time.",
      "revId": "a30f3e626c4627d03f372db4c1ef3dbb35b5d2d1",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
